-What?

262
00:16:55,750 --> 00:16:58,875
Only Fixer Shadow tolerated your temper.

263
00:16:59,375 --> 00:17:01,750
No other fixer is willing
to work with you.

264
00:17:02,666 --> 00:17:05,750
And now his kneecap is injured.

265
00:17:05,833 --> 00:17:08,666
It will take at least six months
for him to recover.

266
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:10,375
I can do it unaided.

267
00:17:10,458 --> 00:17:11,791
Without a partner.

268
00:17:11,875 --> 00:17:15,125
-Especially not that dinosaur over there.
-You condescending fuck.

269
00:17:15,208 --> 00:17:17,166
Fixers work in twos.

270
00:17:17,250 --> 00:17:18,458
That's our rule.

271
00:17:18,958 --> 00:17:22,416
And I've decided,
until Fixer Shadow returns,

272
00:17:22,500 --> 00:17:24,541
that you two are partners.

273
00:17:31,125 --> 00:17:33,208
CHING HE

274
00:17:40,291 --> 00:17:42,375
FELIX CHIANG, AGE 55, NICKNAME: SWAMP EEL

275
00:17:42,458 --> 00:17:44,125
Ching He has three rules.

276
00:17:44,208 --> 00:17:46,625
Fixers must always abide by them.

277
00:17:46,708 --> 00:17:48,583
-Sir Hong.
-All right.

278
00:17:48,666 --> 00:17:50,541
Whether dead or alive,

279
00:17:51,125 --> 00:17:56,250
first, fixers must never reveal
any secrets of Ching He.

280
00:17:57,416 --> 00:17:59,958
Second, fixers must obey orders.

281
00:18:00,833 --> 00:18:03,000
Unless expressly asked to by Ching He,

282
00:18:03,500 --> 00:18:07,000
fixers must never abandon their mission
before completion.

283
00:18:07,666 --> 00:18:10,916
Third, fixers must not reveal
their identity ever,

284
00:18:11,500 --> 00:18:15,250
nor alter their mission objectives
due to personal beliefs.

285
00:18:15,333 --> 00:18:20,208
Okay, then what happens
if a fixer is defiant?

286
00:18:23,041 --> 00:18:24,041
One word.

287
00:18:24,125 --> 00:18:25,083
Death.

288
00:18:25,583 --> 00:18:26,583
Oh.

289
00:18:27,083 --> 00:18:28,541
If you're afraid, you can go.

290
00:18:28,625 --> 00:18:29,833
I'm not afraid.

291
00:18:29,916 --> 00:18:32,916
This game has rules we have to obey.
Don't you know that?

292
00:18:34,500 --> 00:18:38,791
Our mission this time is to destroy
the client's daughter's sex tape.

293
00:18:39,583 --> 00:18:40,500
Who is the client?

294
00:18:40,583 --> 00:18:43,250
A prosecutor
from the district prosecutor's office,

295
00:18:43,333 --> 00:18:44,916
Yen Wen-chieh.

296
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:49,500
Ms. Yen's daughter and the singer Sheng
filmed a sex video.

297
00:18:50,250 --> 00:18:53,708
They were dating at the time.
Now they've broken up.

298
00:18:54,208 --> 00:18:56,958
Miss Yen's worried
the video will be leaked,

299
00:18:57,041 --> 00:19:00,916
so she's contracted Ching He
to make it disappear.

300
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:03,458
Use this to communicate from now on.

301
00:19:03,541 --> 00:19:06,166
Uh, I don't know
what name you're calling me.

302
00:19:06,250 --> 00:19:07,333
Fixer Butthole.

303
00:19:09,208 --> 00:19:11,000
Complete this mission first,

304
00:19:11,500 --> 00:19:12,500
then you'll find out.

305
00:19:17,500 --> 00:19:19,916
What? Is this your car too?

306
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:21,833
Does being a fixer pay that well?

307
00:19:21,916 --> 00:19:23,750
You drive a different car every day.

308
00:19:28,291 --> 00:19:31,666
Hey. I'm your partner.
You can't get rid of me now.

309
00:19:36,458 --> 00:19:38,625
Find an opportunity
to plant this on Sheng.

310
00:19:39,125 --> 00:19:41,166
-Then figure out a way to get his phone.
-And then?

311
00:19:42,625 --> 00:19:43,625
I'll tell you what to do.

312
00:19:44,125 --> 00:19:45,666
Okay, let's drive.

313
00:19:52,791 --> 00:19:55,541
Fuck you! Asswipe!

314
00:19:55,625 --> 00:19:58,541
Disloyal son of a bitch. Shit!

315
00:20:01,708 --> 00:20:04,625
Trackers these days are tiny.

316
00:20:05,166 --> 00:20:06,666
Looks like a button cell battery.

317
00:20:08,666 --> 00:20:10,875
How do I get near that Sheng guy?

318
00:20:19,250 --> 00:20:21,583
BOOHOO, MY TICKET GOT DIRTY

319
00:20:37,041 --> 00:20:39,291
Albums. Album.

320
00:20:42,875 --> 00:20:44,166
CHIA-YUN

321
00:20:53,166 --> 00:20:55,708
Uh, is this the way to the backstage area?

322
00:20:55,791 --> 00:20:57,666
-Are you a staff member?
-No, I'm not.

323
00:20:57,750 --> 00:20:59,625
If you're not staff,
you can't go backstage.

324
00:20:59,708 --> 00:21:00,625
You sure?

325
00:21:03,250 --> 00:21:05,166
The show's started. You'll need to hurry.

326
00:21:12,958 --> 00:21:16,083
As you can see, our entryway
was designed to attract wealth.

327
00:21:16,166 --> 00:21:17,875
For fortune, we hired Master Tang to--

328
00:21:17,958 --> 00:21:20,333
Can you cut the crap? Answer the question.

329
00:21:20,416 --> 00:21:23,208
-Where's the elevator?
-This way, please. This way, thank you.

330
00:21:23,291 --> 00:21:24,250
Let me press the button.

331
00:21:25,416 --> 00:21:26,916
So, who lives in this building?

332
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:29,791
Prominent businesspeople and politicians,
but they're not as handsome--

333
