334
00:21:32,041 --> 00:21:33,833
Oh, no, no, they're not noisy at all.

335
00:21:33,916 --> 00:21:36,291
But I'm not at liberty
to reveal who they are.

336
00:21:36,791 --> 00:21:40,375
I wanna sense the energy
in the living room. Wait over there.

337
00:21:40,458 --> 00:21:41,916
Don't come out till I say.

338
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:43,750
Oh, you want me to…

339
00:21:43,833 --> 00:21:45,916
-Uh-huh.
-Oh. Oh, then…

340
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:49,375
OK. Yell out if you need anything.

341
