347
00:22:44,625 --> 00:22:45,625
Cut the crap.

348
00:22:45,708 --> 00:22:48,791
I used your program to hack the computer,
but there's fuck-all on it.

349
00:22:49,625 --> 00:22:52,000
My guess is
he stored the videos on his phone.

350
00:22:52,750 --> 00:22:54,333
