353
00:23:00,666 --> 00:23:04,041
Send the surveillance footage
from his messaging app straight to me.

354
00:23:08,750 --> 00:23:09,708
Uh… Oh.

355
00:23:09,791 --> 00:23:11,125
Sorry. I'm sorry.

356
00:23:11,208 --> 00:23:13,791
