383
00:25:44,500 --> 00:25:46,166
Uh, excuse me. Excuse me.

384
00:25:46,250 --> 00:25:48,791
Give me your autograph.
Put it on my chest here.

385
00:25:48,875 --> 00:25:51,208
-Sorry, let's not get too close.
-No, no, I really like him.

386
00:25:51,291 --> 00:25:53,750
-I've bought every album. I like you.
-Stand back.

387
00:25:53,833 --> 00:25:56,250
I like you so much.
Give me your autograph.

388
00:25:56,333 --> 00:25:58,583
Oh, don't be like that.
Give me your autograph!

389
00:25:58,666 --> 00:26:00,375
-That's all. Thank you.
-Bye!

390
00:26:11,833 --> 00:26:12,708
Felix Chiang!

391
00:26:12,791 --> 00:26:14,875
