392
00:26:17,000 --> 00:26:19,125
-Don't say you stole it!
-No, listen.

393
00:26:19,208 --> 00:26:22,708
You got it wet and then robbed me.
Do you know how much scalpers charged me?

394
00:26:22,791 --> 00:26:23,875
Will you let me explain?

395
00:26:23,958 --> 00:26:25,916
Since when were you a fan?

396
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:27,583
Uh, never.

397
00:26:28,208 --> 00:26:30,625
