398
00:26:30,708 --> 00:26:33,000
-He insisted I come get his autograph.
-Howie?

399
00:26:33,083 --> 00:26:34,041
He's his idol.

400
00:26:35,166 --> 00:26:36,375
Now, can I ask

401
00:26:37,208 --> 00:26:39,083
