413
00:27:23,083 --> 00:27:23,916
GOT A NEW DROP TODAY

414
00:27:24,000 --> 00:27:26,708
MUST BE NICE TO BE HANDSOME!
WHAT KIND OF FAN IS IT?

415
00:27:26,791 --> 00:27:30,000
FUCK! THE OBSESSIVE TYPE. SUPER FORWARD

