432
00:28:14,833 --> 00:28:18,291
Hey, I worked hard to plant this tracker.
Shouldn't I follow him now?

433
00:28:18,375 --> 00:28:19,500
Who said that it's a tracker?

434
00:28:20,833 --> 00:28:21,916
