a button cell battery on him?

438
00:28:31,541 --> 00:28:33,750
You tell me. You planted it.

439
00:28:34,625 --> 00:28:38,791
Man, I show you respect,
and now this is all I get.

440
00:28:39,666 --> 00:28:40,750
