485
00:32:41,166 --> 00:32:42,208
Bingo.

486
00:32:49,000 --> 00:32:49,916
Now…

487
00:32:52,166 --> 00:32:53,375
have you ever tried

488
00:32:55,125 --> 00:32:57,000
