507
00:36:17,125 --> 00:36:18,416
I understand.

508
00:36:18,500 --> 00:36:20,458
Go and deliver the phone to Ms. Yen.

509
00:36:21,125 --> 00:36:22,125
Felix,

510
00:36:22,208 --> 00:36:24,875
