you've been very resourceful.

511
00:36:24,958 --> 00:36:27,958
Yeah, yeah.
You should know I'm pissed off.

512
00:36:28,041 --> 00:36:31,416
This asshole tried to pass off
a button cell battery as a tracker.

513
00:36:31,500 --> 00:36:33,958
Luckily, I was two steps ahead of him,

514
00:36:34,041 --> 00:36:36,041
and I switched his phone with my phone.

515
00:36:37,375 --> 00:36:40,041
I wanted to see
what you were capable of, old man.

516
00:36:40,125 --> 00:36:42,541
Now, hold on.
I need to buy a new phone now.

517
00:36:42,625 --> 00:36:43,625
Can I get reimbursed?

518
00:36:43,708 --> 00:36:46,958
Of course. It's good to hear
you're working well together.

519
00:36:47,041 --> 00:36:48,250
All right, get going.

520
00:36:48,333 --> 00:36:50,541
Hey, where'd you get that idea?

521
00:36:51,083 --> 00:36:52,083
This jerk…

522
00:36:54,083 --> 00:36:56,208
No money yet, and I need new tires.

523
00:36:56,291 --> 00:36:59,791
I'm going down the toilet here.
Listen, you're paying for those.

524
00:37:01,208 --> 00:37:02,375
Ridiculous.

525
00:37:04,250 --> 00:37:06,750
Ms. Yen, I have a child of my own.

526
00:37:06,833 --> 00:37:08,666
I understand how you feel.

527
00:37:19,333 --> 00:37:23,333
Hey. That Yeh Yueh Tong, who are they?

528
00:37:24,125 --> 00:37:27,041
-It would mean nothing to you.
-You gonna say or not?

529
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:34,000
Their founder was
excommunicated from Ching He.

530
00:37:34,083 --> 00:37:38,083
After she started up her own organization,
she took a lot of their business.

531
00:37:45,500 --> 00:37:47,708
I can't watch anymore. I can't.

532
00:37:47,791 --> 00:37:50,625
It's not just your daughter's videos.

533
00:37:50,708 --> 00:37:53,833
As long as they're all deleted,
no one will be able to use them again.

534
00:37:53,916 --> 00:37:57,250
There were no backups made.
Once they're deleted, it's over.

535
00:37:57,333 --> 00:37:58,375
Delete them all.

536
00:38:10,208 --> 00:38:12,708
If this sort of thing
happened to my child,

537
00:38:13,958 --> 00:38:15,458
I'd be at a loss too.

538
00:38:17,041 --> 00:38:18,625
Fixers aren't shrinks.

539
00:38:20,916 --> 00:38:23,125
No one cares if you're empathetic.

540
00:38:23,208 --> 00:38:25,750
What? You heartless bastard.

541
00:38:27,166 --> 00:38:29,416
You didn't see that Sheng guy yourself.

542
00:38:29,500 --> 00:38:31,791
From the look of him,
he's a regular cocaine user.

543
00:38:41,833 --> 00:38:42,666
CHIA-YUN

544
00:38:42,750 --> 00:38:45,083
Ah, fuck!

545
00:38:45,166 --> 00:38:47,375
Chen Chia-yun's gonna chew me out.

546
00:38:57,458 --> 00:38:59,541
SHENG'S EXPLICIT VIDEO GOES VIRAL

547
00:38:59,625 --> 00:39:02,916
What? How'd this happen?
Weren't all the videos deleted?

548
00:39:03,000 --> 00:39:04,791
It's not Miss Yen's daughter.

549
00:39:04,875 --> 00:39:06,041
There's another victim.

550
00:39:08,583 --> 00:39:10,291
You're like my family.

551
00:39:10,375 --> 00:39:12,291
Don't leave me alone…

552
00:39:12,375 --> 00:39:14,583
Without you, I wouldn't be here.

553
00:39:14,666 --> 00:39:15,791
DISGUSTING. DROP HIM.

554
00:39:15,875 --> 00:39:17,375
SURELY SHE LURED HIM

555
00:39:17,458 --> 00:39:19,375
I'll definitely come back again.

556
00:39:19,458 --> 00:39:22,875
Don't leave me alone

557
00:39:47,166 --> 00:39:50,875
Hire thugs, investigators, I don't care.
Find that woman for me.

558
00:39:51,958 --> 00:39:53,458
We've got an account number.

559
00:39:53,541 --> 00:39:55,041
And no cops.

560
00:39:55,666 --> 00:39:56,666
You got that?

561
00:39:57,333 --> 00:39:58,750
You got that?

562
00:40:08,708 --> 00:40:11,708
Yeh Yueh Tong hasn't even made a move yet,

563
00:40:12,250 --> 00:40:15,500
but Ching He's
already knocking on our door.

564
00:40:24,166 --> 00:40:25,625
-Madam Fan.
-Mm.

565
00:40:27,208 --> 00:40:28,958
This should get fun.
